flowchart TD
    Loading[LoadingScene / Editor auto bootstrap] --> Migration[Legacy settings migration]
    Migration --> Base[Device / Audio / Haptics / Settings / UI / Overlays]
    Base --> Ready{Base Ready?}
    Ready -->|yes| SDK[Start optional SDK adapters]
    Ready -->|no| Error[Report startup configuration error]
    SDK --> Main[Main menu]
    Main --> Hearts{Can start session?}
    Hearts -->|yes| Play[Match-3 session]
    Play --> Resolve[Match / Blocker / Gravity / Refill]
    Resolve --> Play
    Play --> Result[Win / Lose]
    Result --> Meta[Commit progression and rewards]
    Meta --> Main
